chapter.v:
beatings, imprisonments, 


riots, labors,, 


sleepless nights, hunger;

by purity, 


knowledge, patience,, 


kindness, the Holy Spirit, genuine love;

by truthful 


speech, and, 


the power of God; with the weapons of righteousness for the right hand and for the left;

through honor 


and dishonor,, 


through slander and praise. We are treated as impostors, and yet are true;

as unknown, 


and yet, 


well known; as dying, and behold, we live; as punished, and yet not killed;
